==English==

===Etymology===
From [[head]] + [[master]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɑːstə(r)}}

===Synonyms===
* [[headteacher]] ''(UK, gender-neutral)''
* [[principal]] ''(US, gender-neutral)''

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# ''(Chiefly British.)'' A male school [[principal]].

